 identified was Bundibugyo, for which there is no licensed vaccine.\\\",\\\"support\\\":[\\\"The Guardian\\\"]},{\\\"fact\\\":\\\"BBC reported at least six Americans were exposed during the DRC outbreak, with one reportedly symptomatic.\\\",\\\"support\\\":[\\\"BBC News\\\"]},{\\\"fact\\\":\\\"The outbreak is complicated by high population movement through mining towns and border regions.\\\",\\\"support\\\":[\\\"The Guardian\\\"]},{\\\"fact\\\":\\\"Africa CDC said rapid regional coordination is essential and convened an urgent meeting with DRC, Uganda, South Sudan, WHO, and pharmaceutical companies.\\\",\\\"support\\\":[\\\"The Guardian\\\"]}],\\\"sources\\\":[{\\\"outlet\\\":\\\"The Guardian\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Ebola outbreak kills 65 people in eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2026/may/15/ebola-outbreak-drc-africa-deaths\\\",\\\"pubDate\\\":\\\"2026-05-15T18:22:04Z\\\"},{\\\"outlet\\\":\\\"BBC News\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"At least six Americans exposed to Ebola during DR Congo outbreak\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/\\\",\\\"pubDate\\\":\\\"2026-05-18T05:00:33Z\\\"}],\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"primary\\\":\\\"Ituri province, Democratic Republic of the Congo\\\",\\\"secondary\\\":[\\\"Bunia\\\",\\\"Mongwalu\\\",\\\"Rwampara\\\",\\\"Kampala, Uganda\\\",\\\"South Sudan border region\\\"]},\\\"public_health_risk\\\":{\\\"severity\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"reasons\\\":[\\\"Fatal disease\\\",\\\"Active cross-border transmission risk\\\",\\\"No licensed vaccine for the identified strain\\\",\\\"Population movement across affected areas\\\"]},\\\"confidence\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The BBC feed item was only partially visible in the RSS extract, so its facts are limited to the headline/description surfaced there.\\\",\\\"The Guardian report provided the richest verified detail and anchors the event identification.\\\"]}\\n<<<END_UNTRUSTED_CHILD_RESULT>>>\\n\\nStats: runtime