memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md","startLine":209,"endLine":264,"score":1,"textScore":0.6743224650353566,"snippet":"**Problem:**  \nThe pipeline spans multiple long steps:\n- research\n- writing\n- chart\n- image\n- drive publish\n- optional wordpress publish\n\nThat is bigger than a fragile step-by-step chat reply chain.\n\n**Fix needed:**  \nUse one durable execution owner for the whole run.\n\n### Best design options\n\n#### Option A — Best recommendation\nRun the full pipeline inside **one durable background workflow** that owns Steps 0–5 end-to-end, and only message you at meaningful milestones.\n\nWhy this is best:\n- avoids chat-turn fragmentation\n- avoids accidental stopping after status messages\n- easier resume/recovery\n- clearer single source of truth\n\n#### Option B — Acceptable\nKeep the current chat orchestration\n\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L209-L264","source":"memory","citation":"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L209-L264","corpus":"memory"},{"id":"e8df757c55657f3db361e35b7f0ebac421b66ede22cfb34ae11f75477fe135b4","path":"memory/2026-05-18-chart-fix.md","startLine":86,"endLine":135,"score":1,"textScore":0.6655886518438168,"snippet":"of silently continuing\\n\\nIf you want, I can patch the pipeline so future Google Docs include the chart correctly.\"\n}\n```\n\nno you do not do anything just let me know what to fix\nassistant: [[reply_to_current]] Yep — here’s **exactly what needs fixing**, nothing more:\n\n### 1) Fix the chart generator\nThe chart step is producing something that is **not a real PNG**.\n\nWhat to fix:\n- Make sure the chart agent writes a **valid PNG binary** to:\n  - `/tmp/chart.png`\n- Make sure it does **not** write text/log output into the chart file\n- Make sure the generator respects:\n  - `CHART_OUTPUT: /tmp/chart.png`\n\n### 2) Fix the DOCX export step\nRight now the export only prepends the feature image and never\n\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-chart-fix.md#L86-L135","source":"memory","citation":"memory/